;
; Minimal .def file for the Windows synchronization APIs QEMU's
; include/qemu/futex.h uses (WaitOnAddress/WakeByAddressSingle/
; WakeByAddressAll), used to synthesize a libsynchronization.a import
; library with `zig dlltool` when cross-compiling for Windows with
; `zig cc` (see scripts/build-with-zig-cc-windows.sh).
;
; Same rationale as pathcch.def in this directory: zig's bundled
; mingw-w64 subset ships the underlying API-set forwarder DLL's own
; .def file (lib/libc/mingw/lib-common/api-ms-win-core-synch-l1-2-0.def,
; symbol list copied verbatim below) but not the "libsynchronization.a"
; friendly-name alias QEMU's meson.build looks up via
; `cc.find_library('synchronization', required: true)`.
;
LIBRARY api-ms-win-core-synch-l1-2-0

EXPORTS

DeleteSynchronizationBarrier
EnterSynchronizationBarrier
InitializeConditionVariable
InitializeSynchronizationBarrier
InitOnceBeginInitialize
InitOnceComplete
InitOnceExecuteOnce
InitOnceInitialize
SignalObjectAndWait
Sleep
SleepConditionVariableCS
SleepConditionVariableSRW
WaitOnAddress
WakeAllConditionVariable
WakeByAddressAll
WakeByAddressSingle
WakeConditionVariable
